# Comprehensive Flutter Architecture Design for SimpleCRM Cross-Platform Application

## Executive Summary

This architectural design transforms the existing SimpleCRM Spring Boot application from server-side rendering to a modern cross-platform Flutter application supporting web, iOS, and Android deployments. The design emphasizes clean architecture, scalable state management, secure authentication, and responsive UI patterns.

## 1. Flutter Architecture Design for Web/iOS/Android

